## Customization

| Theme token | Used for |
|-------------|----------|
| `--tx-text-color-primary` | Row label color. |
| `--tx-text-color-secondary` | Caret and empty state. |
| `--tx-color-primary` | Selected row tint. |
| `--tx-fill-color` | Hover row tint. |
